cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this artifact, cite it anonymously until double-blind review concludes."
title: "HPAT Reproducibility Artifact"
type: software
version: 1.0.1
authors:
  - name: "Anonymous Artifact Authors"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for bounded architecture-level optoelectronic
  acceleration experiments on MobileViT-style vision Transformers. Results are
  local model diagnostics, not fabricated-silicon, measured HPAT timing or
  energy, mobile-deployment, or full-ImageNet evidence.
keywords:
  - artifact evaluation
  - MobileViT
  - optoelectronic acceleration
  - reproducibility
license: Apache-2.0
